<body data-new-gr-c-s-loaded="14.1045.0" style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><br />
<b>Thanks for contacting Qantas Freight</b><br/><br/>
We know that saying goodbye to a loved one is hard, and we appreciate how difficult this time will be for the family.
<br/><br/>
With the added stress of being away from home, we’re here to provide all the support needed to arrange this very sensitive trip.
<br/><br/>
Rest assured, we'll arrange to fly the family's loved one back home and ensure they’re treated with the utmost dignity while
 in our care and travel with the highest priority throughout the journey.
<br><br/>
We’ve created a reference number for you, {!Case.CaseNumber}. Please quote this if you need to contact us urgently. Our number is 13 12 13, and we’re available during business hours, or you can use the chat function on our <a href='https://freight.qantas.com/'>website.</a>
<br/>
<br/>
We’ll be back in touch shortly. In the meantime, here are the details you’ve provided us with so far:
<br/>
<br/>
<table cellpadding="5" style="border-collapse: collapse" width="860" border="0">
<tr>
   <td>Type:</td>
     <td>{!Case.Type}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Subject:</td>
<td>{!Case.Subject}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Origin:</td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_Origin__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Destination:</td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_Destination__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Lodgement Date and Time:</td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_Lodgement_Date_Time__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Shipment Details:</td>
<td>{!Case.Team_Position__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>No. of pieces:</td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_AWB_Pieces__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Est. weight (inc. packaging):</td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_Weight__c} </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Length:</td>
<td>{!Case.FreightLength__c} </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Width:</td>
<td>{!Case.FreightWidth__c} </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Height:</td>
<td>{!Case.FreightHeight__c} </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Passenger Accompanying:</td>
<td>{!Case.No_New_Team__c} </td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Let us know how we can help:</td>
<td>{!Case.Description}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Sender name:</td>
<td>{!Case.SuppliedName}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Sender number:</td>
<td>{!Case.Business_Phone_Number__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Sender Email:</td>
<td>{!Case.Email__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Receiver name:</td>
<td>{!Case.Assessor_Name__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Receiver number:</td>
<td>{!Case.Default_Business_Phone__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Receiver Email:</td>
<td>{!Case.User_s_Email__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Booking Name:</td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_Customer_Name__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Booking Number:</td>
<td>{!Case.Consultant_Phone__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Booking Email:</td>
<td>{!Case.Consultant_Email__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Booking Account Number:</td>
<td>{!Case.Freight_Customer_No__c}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td >Company Name:</td>
<td>{!Case.SuppliedCompany}</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Date/time of Query Submission:</td>
<td>{!Case.CreatedDate}</td>
</tr>
</table>

<br/>
<br/>
Thanks for choosing us to help manage this special movement.<br />
<br/>
<br />
The Qantas Freight Team<br />
